      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我也有这种执念……所以这个角色，必须由我圣王扮演。\n我一定要出色发挥，展示一场史上最精彩的演出……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "63089ea45386f947cf893a0c266871c0a12d6419f9b119709e9e0cab1c433cb2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
